            "heading": "Do you offer samples?",
            "icon": "key",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>No—and here’s why.</p><p>Our program is designed to be a <strong>marathon, not a sprint</strong>. Real change takes time. A one-day sample won’t show you what Detox, SVMS, or Immune Support can do when used consistently and correctly. So rather than handing out false hope in tiny sachets, we’d rather get you set up with a proper protocol that actually works.</p><p>We do, however, offer <strong>kits and bundles</strong> at great value so you can try the full combination that gets results.</p>",
