        "collapsible_row_KyRx3K": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "Can your products help with anhidrosis (non-sweating)?",
            "icon": "key",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes—<strong>and not just a little bit.</strong> We’ve seen horses go from bone dry to dripping wet in a matter of weeks using our <strong>Parkmore Anhidrosis Protocol</strong>, which includes all <strong>four</strong> key products:</p><ul><li> <strong>Detox</strong> – to bind and flush out toxins and heavy metals that may be blocking the sweat response.</li><li> <strong>SVMS (Vitamin & Mineral Supplement)</strong> – a powerful micronutrient blend to reset the system and restore balance.</li><li> <strong>Herbal Infusion (HI)</strong> – herbs soaked in oil or made into a paste, these target the glands and kickstart the body's sweat response.</li><li> <strong>Immune Support</strong> – critical for rebuilding the immune system, which is often burnt out in non-sweaters.</li></ul><p>This isn’t a quick fix—it’s a <strong>total system reset</strong>. And yes, all four are essential. Cutting corners gets you half a result.</p><p>If your horse is struggling, don’t wait. Reach out—we’ll walk you through exactly how to use it.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
