        "collapsible_row_Cyd9nk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What Parkmore Products do you recommend for Heaves (COPD, RAO)?",
            "icon": "storefront",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>1.  Immune Support</strong></p><ul><li>Core product to <strong>reduce inflammation</strong>, support <strong>mucosal immunity</strong>, and help the lungs <strong>heal on a cellular level</strong>.</li><li>Improves <strong>resilience</strong> to dust, mold, and pollen triggers.</li></ul><p><strong>2.  Detox</strong></p><ul><li>Cleans out <strong>gut toxins</strong> and reduces overall inflammatory load.</li><li>Many respiratory flare-ups are <strong>immune-triggered</strong>—Detox helps reduce those overreactions from the inside out.</li></ul><p><strong>3.  SVMS (Vitamin & Mineral Supplement)</strong></p><ul><li>Supplies essential <strong>micronutrients for tissue repair</strong>, especially in the lungs and airway lining.</li><li>Heaves horses often have <strong>underlying deficiencies</strong> from years of stress or poor absorption.</li></ul><p><strong>4.  Herbal Infusion (HI)</strong></p><ul><li>Contains herbs that support the <strong>respiratory tract</strong>, boost <strong>circulation</strong>, and help <strong>expel mucus</strong>.</li><li>Also calms the system and helps break the cycle of tight breathing.</li></ul>",
