        "collapsible_row_a4VqMj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What is the Parkmore Immune Support product?",
            "icon": "storefront",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>The <strong>Parkmore Immune Support</strong> is a <strong>yeast-based nucleotide supplement</strong> designed to <strong>boost immune function, speed up recovery, and support cell regeneration</strong>—from the inside out.</p><p>Nucleotides are the <strong>building blocks of DNA and RNA</strong>. Every time your horse’s body needs to repair tissue, fight infection, or generate new cells—it needs nucleotides. The problem is, horses under stress, in recovery, or dealing with chronic conditions like allergies, ulcers, or infections often can’t produce enough of them fast enough.</p><p><em>That’s where Parkmore’s Immune Support steps in.</em></p><h3> What It Does:</h3><ul><li><strong>Rebuilds damaged cells</strong> faster</li><li><strong>Supports immune resilience</strong> during stress, illness, or recovery</li><li><strong>Enhances absorption and responsiveness</strong> to medications and supplements</li><li>Helps the gut, skin, lungs, and immune system <strong>repair and reset</strong></li></ul><h3>Why It Works:</h3><p>We use a <strong>premium yeast-derived nucleotide base</strong>, meaning it’s <strong>easily absorbed and fast-acting</strong>—no fillers, no fluff. This is a serious support tool for horses who are struggling with:</p><ul><li>Allergies</li><li>Chronic infections</li><li>Ulcers</li><li>Immune suppression (e.g. Cushing’s, long-term meds)</li><li>Recovery from illness, surgery, or transport stress</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
            "button_style_1_show_arrow": false,
            "button_style_1_show_gradient_border": false,
            "button_1_border_gradient": "linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qQc8pV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "Why does Parkmore Immune Support accelerate the absorption of medications or other supplements?",
            "icon": "storefront",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Because it helps the body work <strong>more efficiently—at the cellular level.</strong></p><p>Parkmore Immune Support is made from <strong>yeast-based nucleotides</strong>, which are the building blocks of RNA and DNA. In other words: it gives your horse the raw materials needed for <strong>cell replication, repair, and regeneration</strong>.</p><p>When cells are healthy and functioning properly, they:</p><ul><li>Absorb nutrients more efficiently</li><li>Repair damaged tissue faster</li><li>Transport compounds (like medications) more effectively</li><li>Boost the body’s own natural response system</li></ul><p>So if your horse is on medication, you may notice those meds <strong>“kick in” quicker or work better</strong>. It’s not that Immune Support makes the meds stronger—it’s that your horse’s system becomes <strong>more receptive and responsive</strong>.</p><p><strong>Think of it like this:</strong> <em>It’s the difference between pouring fuel into a clogged-up engine vs. a clean, well-tuned one. Same fuel. Different results.</em></p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
