        "collapsible_row_8wcxPa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What’s in Parkmore Herbal Infusion—and Why",
            "icon": "storefront",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p><strong> Fenugreek</strong></p><ul><li>Stimulates appetite</li><li>Soothes the gut</li><li>Supports blood sugar balance—ideal for metabolic horses</li></ul><p><strong> Fennel Seed</strong></p><ul><li>Reduces gas and bloating</li><li>Supports digestive and respiratory health</li><li>Gentle antioxidant and anti-inflammatory</li></ul><p><strong> Oregano & Thyme</strong></p><ul><li>Natural antimicrobials</li><li>Support healthy lungs and reduce congestion</li></ul><p><strong> Turmeric</strong></p><ul><li>Powerful anti-inflammatory</li><li>Supports joints, gut lining, and skin health</li></ul><p><strong> Black Cumin Seed</strong></p><ul><li>Regulates immune response</li><li>Supports lungs, digestion, and skin</li></ul><p><strong> Salt & Bicarbonate of Soda</strong></p><ul><li>Promote hydration and pH balance</li><li>Aid gut health and metabolic recovery</li></ul><p><strong>Yeast Sacc 1026</strong> <em>(NOT the same as the Immune Support yeast)</em></p><ul><li>A <strong>live probiotic yeast</strong> that supports <strong>gut flora, feed efficiency, and digestion</strong></li><li>Helps stabilise the hindgut, especially in horses recovering from stress, meds, or feed changes</li><li>Improves <strong>nutrient absorption</strong>—great when paired with Detox and SVMS</li></ul><h3> In short:</h3><p>The <strong>Herbal Infusion</strong> is a multi-tasking blend that supports the <strong>lungs, gut, immune system, and appetite</strong>—while laying the groundwork for long-term health.</p>",
